low-hidden transform transition-all hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1\\\"><div class=\\\"h-48 bg-orange-500 flex items-center justify-center\\\"><div class=\\\"w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-users w-12 h-12 text-white\\\"><path d=\\\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\\\"></path><circle cx=\\\"9\\\" cy=\\\"7\\\" r=\\\"4\\\"></circle><path d=\\\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\\\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\\\"p-6\\\"><h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-1\\\">Md. Shafiqul Islam Akand</h3><p class=\\\"text-blue-900 font-medium mb-4\\\">Chief Operating Officer</p><p class=\\\"text-gray-600 mb-4\\\">The highest-ranking Bangladeshi official in DBEDC, responsible for local operations, regulatory liaison, and ensuring the project meets all local standards and guidelines.</p><div class=\\\"flex items-center text-gray-700 mb-2\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-building w-4 h-4 mr-2\\\"><rect width=\\\"16\\\" height=\\\"20\\\" x=\\\"4\\\" y=\\\"2\\\" rx=\\\"2\\\" ry=\\\"2\\\"></rect><path d=\\\"M9 22v-4h6v4\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M8 6h.01\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M16 6h.01\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M12 6h.01\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M12 10h.01\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M12 14h.01\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M16 10h.01\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M16 14h.01\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M8 10h.01\\\"></path><path d=\\\"M8 14h.01\\\"></path></svg><span class=\\\"text-sm\\\">Bangladesh Operations Lead</span></div><div class=\\\"flex items-center text-gray-700\\\"><svg xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" width=\\\"24\\\" height=\\\"24\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" class=\\\"lucide lucide-mail w-4 h-4 mr-2\\\"><rect width=\\\"20\\\" height=\\\"16\\\" x=\\\"2\\\" y=\\\"4\\\" rx=\\\"2\\\"></rect><path d=\\\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\\\"></path></svg><span class=\\\"text-sm\\\">s_akand@yahoo.com</span></div></div></div></div><div class=\\\"bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-8 mt-12\\\"><h3 class=\\\"text-xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4 uppercase\\\">Project Governance Structure</h3><p class=\\\"text-gray-700 mb-6\\\">The Dhaka Bypass Expressway is governed through a structured approach that ensures proper oversight, clear accountability, and effective coordination among all stakeholders.</p><div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\\\"><div class=\\\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm\\\"><h4 class=\\\"font-bold text-blue-900 mb-3\\\">Board of Directors</h4><p class=\\\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\\\">The Board comprises representatives from all equity partners (SRBG, SEL, and UDC), with proportional representation based on shareholding. The Board provides strategic direction and major decision approval.</p></div><div class=\\\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm\\\"><h4 class=\\\"font-bold text-blue-900 mb-3\\\">Executive Management</h4><p class=\\\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\\\">Led by the CEO with support from the COO and General Managers, the executive team handles day-to-day operations, project delivery, stakeholder management, and performance reporting.</p></div><div class=\\\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm\\\"><h4 class=\\\"font-bold text-blue-900 mb-3\\\">Government Oversight</h4><p class=\\\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\\\">The Project Director from RHD (Syed Aslam Ali) monitors progress, ensures compliance with the concession agreement, and acts as the primary liaison between DBEDC and government agencies.</p></div></div></div></section></main><section class=\\\"py-16 bg-blue-900 text-white\\\"><div class=\\\"container mx-auto px-4 text-center\\\"><h2 class=\\\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold mb-6\\\">Discover How This Collaboration Is Transforming Bangladesh</h2><p class=\\\"text-lg text-white/80 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8\\\">Learn more about how the partnerships behind the Dhaka Bypass Expressway are creating lasting impact through innovative infrastructure development</p><div class=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4\\\"><a href=\\\"/project\\\" class=\\\"bg-white text-blue-900 hover:bg-gray-100 px-8 py-3 rounded-md transition-all\\\">Explore the Project</a><a href=\\\"/contact\\\" class=\\\"bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-400 text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-md transition-all\\\">Contact Our Team</a></div></div></section><button class=\\\"fixed bottom-8 right-8 bg-blue-900 hover:bg-blue-800 text-white w-12 h-12 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg transition-all z-40\\\"><svg class=\\\"w-6 h-6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M5 10l7-7m0 0l7 7m-7-7v18\\\"></path></svg></button>\"}]}"